🎯 8. Importance for Design Verification Engineers
Benefit	                          Why It Matters
Early bug detection	        Immediate alerts when illegal signal states occur
Protocol validation	        Ensures DUT signals follow expected handshake rules
Automation	                   Reduces manual waveform inspection
Standard reporting	        error, $fatal integrate with regression tools
Documentation	        Acts as live specification of design intent

